  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO - Girls&#x2019; Lower Secondary Education Programme (GLSEP) in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims at supporting the provincial governments in improving girls&#x2019; transition from primary to lower secondary education, increasing access to schools and enhancing learning through a holistic approach to quality education at secondary level.</narrative>
  </description>
